{"game": "mass-effect-andromeda", "language": "english", "appid": 1238000, "month": "2021-09", "window": 3, "start_date": 1631750400, "end_date": 1632355199, "month_true_total": 182, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 21:55:42 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "99809424", "author": {"steamid": "76561197974173590", "personaname": "jc01_rob02", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197974173590/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 12562, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2404, "last_played": 1638053731, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "english", "review": "I love playing this as much as the previous three.", "timestamp_created": 1632349058, "timestamp_updated": 1632349058, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "99808523", "author": {"steamid": "76561197986325235", "personaname": "EPX", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/epxplaya/", "num_games_owned": 352, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 779, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 779, "last_played": 1632347063, "avatar": "1d18ca319c9410956f7c31a17b81617c465eb686"}, "language": "english", "review": "The dialogue is cringe inducing. The characters are shallow. The combat and multiplayer are not good enough to keep me playing when I want to gouge out my eyes whenever someone opens their mouth.", "timestamp_created": 1632347313, "timestamp_updated": 1632347408, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.500667572021484375", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "99801974", "author": {"steamid": "76561198968060793", "personaname": "Deftoads", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198968060793/", "num_games_owned": 450, "num_reviews": 9, "playtime_forever": 114, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 112, "last_played": 1632405302, "avatar": "d48e57dc4672700340cfa24a7bd40409dee829f6"}, "language": "english", "review": "I have many more hours than what is depicted here on steam, as i played this a lot offline while my internet was being worked on.\n\nThat being said, I had plenty of time to get into this game and touch a bit of everything it had to offer. From the gameplay to the story, and everything in between. \n\nI think its a good game. I can see why people would be upset, but it is not exactly called mass effect 4, so It was a new attempt on the franchise with perhaps a different game design philosophy in mind. I enjoyed the original trilogy on the xbox, and I fully intend to buy them again for my steam, but playing this did feel like a different type of game from what fans are perhaps used to. I don't think it deserves all the heat, and even if the face animations were bad (still are a bit) Idk how that ruined the game on a whole, which it hasn't but depending on who you ask the game is unplayable.\n\nThe guns feel nice, the story is fine with some predictable spots, and I enjoyed developing weapons and gear along with making particular choices when it came to how settlements were done. Play it before you jump on an ancient hate bandwagon.", "timestamp_created": 1632336801, "timestamp_updated": 1632336801, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "99791374", "author": {"steamid": "76561198280984833", "personaname": "nazara", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198280984833/", "num_games_owned": 52, "num_reviews": 10, "playtime_forever": 10051, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2916, "last_played": 1735389832, "avatar": "71fa6902a97975a765af6d6dad86478bda68be55"}, "language": "english", "review": "good gay space content", "timestamp_created": 1632323201, "timestamp_updated": 1632323201, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 2, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "99782802", "author": {"steamid": "76561198003270449", "personaname": "SparkyTheSec0nd", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/SparkyTheSec0nd/", "num_games_owned": 330, "num_reviews": 32, "playtime_forever": 3967, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3264, "last_played": 1674115424, "avatar": "3a0ce835c10abc0fe155da4b81866169f4ca7113"}, "language": "english", "review": "This game isn't as bad as people tend to say it is, it has its problems sure, but at its core it is still an enjoyable RPG which you can spend hours playing and exploring. The Mass Effect Trilogy is probably better overall, but that doesn't mean you skip out on Andromeda. I didn't think I would like it, and yet here I am, writing a positive review after finishing it, and enjoying most of my time on it.", "timestamp_created": 1632311616, "timestamp_updated": 1632376316, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_